          "guidance": "For an eligible stock transfer where an 83(b) election has been chosen, confirm the actual transfer date and the 30-day filing deadline, including the IRS weekend and legal-holiday rule. Atlas describes automatic filing for its C-corp founders; confirm that it is handling this election. Track the filing and retain the signed election. Use Atlas’s proof-of-filing document and the official USPS tracking record to check the mailing event against the deadline. Provide a copy to the company for which services were performed and to any different transferee, then retain the copies with the filing record."
