          "vendor": "clerky",
          "guidance": "For an eligible stock transfer where an 83(b) election has been chosen, confirm the actual transfer date and the 30-day filing deadline, including the IRS weekend and legal-holiday rule. Clerky’s post-incorporation setup supplies a pre-filled election and filing instructions. Review the form against the completed stock transaction and confirm who will submit it; document preparation does not establish that a filing service has been arranged. Track submission against the deadline, provide the required company and transferee copies, and retain the signed election with evidence of timely filing."
